# Run artefacts from the ingest/prediction scripts
*.log
*.nohup.out
tags_backup_*.json

# APNs auth key. Unlike GoogleService-Info.plist — whose API key is a client
# identifier scoped to the bundle id — this one is a real credential: it can
# send push to every app on the team, it never expires, and Apple lets you
# download it exactly once.
*.p8

# Firebase service account private keys. These sign as the project itself —
# anything holding one can send push to every install and read whatever the
# service account can reach. Never commit, never ship in a client bundle.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
